  "Set the game difficulty.": "",
  "A difficulty that lets you enjoy the story without having to worry about difficult gameplay.": "",
  "The highest difficulty setting. Select this only if you're super confident as a gamer (or if you're just crazy).": "",
  "Camera Control (Vertical)": "",
  "Change how to move the camera vertically. Normal moves the camera in the direction you tilt the <input_device_not=KEYBOARD_AND_MOUSE>right ${platform.term.stick}<input_device=KEYBOARD_AND_MOUSE><input_device=KEYBOARD_AND_MOUSE><symbol=mouse_moveint></input_device>. Inverted moves the camera opposite to the direction you tilt.": "",
  "Camera Control (Horizontal)": "",
  "Change how to move the camera horizontally. Normal moves the camera in the direction you tilt the <input_device_not=KEYBOARD_AND_MOUSE>right ${platform.term.stick}<input_device=KEYBOARD_AND_MOUSE><input_device=KEYBOARD_AND_MOUSE><symbol=mouse_moveint></input_device>. Inverted moves the camera opposite to the direction you tilt.": "",
  "Camera Movement Speed": "",
  "Set the speed the camera moves at. \nSlide the cursor to adjust the speed.": "",
  "First-Person View (Vertical)": "",
  "Change how to move the first-person camera vertically. Normal moves the camera in the direction you tilt the <input_device_not=KEYBOARD_AND_MOUSE>right ${platform.term.stick}<input_device=KEYBOARD_AND_MOUSE><input_device=KEYBOARD_AND_MOUSE><symbol=mouse_moveint></input_device>. Inverted moves the camera opposite to the direction you tilt.": "",
  "First-Person View (Horizontal)": "",
